{"legend":"<h2 id=\"problem-statement\">Problem Statement</h2> \n<p><strong>The correct answer to this problem is worth 10 points.</strong></p> \n<p>There is a rare disease that affects <strong>1%</strong> of the population.</p> \n<p>To diagnose this disease, a new test has been developed that works as follows:</p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>If a person is <strong>actually sick</strong>, the test will show a positive result in <strong>99%</strong> of cases.</p></li> \n <li><p>If a person is <strong>healthy</strong>, the test will show a negative result in <strong>98%</strong> of cases.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<h2 id=\"theory\">Theory</h2> \n<p><strong>Probability</strong></p> \n<p><em>Intuitively</em> Probability is a number from 0 to 1 that shows how \"expected\" an event is:<br> 0 — impossible, 1 — will definitely happen, the middle — \"maybe\" with a certain chance.</p> \n<p><em>Formally</em> The probability of an event <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> is the value of the probability measure <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(A)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> (a function that assigns a number from 0 to 1 to events), where: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mn>\n         0\n        </mn>\n        <mo>\n         ≤\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         ≤\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         1\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n        <mspace width=\"1em\" />\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n         Ω\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         1\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n        <mspace width=\"1em\" />\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n         ∅\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         0\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        0 \\leq P(A) \\leq 1,\\quad P(\\Omega)=1,\\quad P(\\varnothing)=0,\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span> where <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n        Ω\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       \\Omega\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> is the entire sample space, and <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n        ∅\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       \\varnothing\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span> is the impossible event. For equally likely outcomes: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mfrac>\n         <mtext>\n          number&nbsp;of&nbsp;favorable&nbsp;outcomes\n         </mtext>\n         <mtext>\n          total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;outcomes\n         </mtext>\n        </mfrac>\n        <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\n         .\n        </mi>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        P(A) = \\frac{\\text{number of favorable outcomes}}{\\text{total number of outcomes}}.\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;outcomes</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">number&nbsp;of&nbsp;favorable&nbsp;outcomes</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n<p><em>Application</em></p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>Data analysis: the proportion of users who made a purchase is interpreted as an estimate of <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          purchase\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{purchase})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">purchase</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n <li><p>ML: the output of a classifier model (e.g., 0.83) is treated as an estimate of <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          class\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mn>\n          1\n         </mn>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          features\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{class}=1 \\mid \\text{features})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">class</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">features</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<p><strong>Conditional Probability</strong></p> \n<p><em>Intuitively</em> This is \"probability within a filter\": it is already known that <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> has occurred, and we are interested in the chance of <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> among those cases, not among all cases.</p> \n<p><em>Formally</em> The conditional probability of <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> given <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> is defined as: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo>\n         ∣\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         B\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mfrac>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           A\n          </mi>\n          <mo>\n           ∩\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n        </mfrac>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n        <mspace width=\"1em\" />\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         B\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         &gt;\n        </mo>\n        <mn>\n         0\n        </mn>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        P(A \\mid B) = \\frac{P(A \\cap B)}{P(B)}, \\quad P(B) &gt; 0,\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span> where <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo>\n        ∩\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A \\cap B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> means \"both events occurring simultaneously\".</p> \n<p><em>Application</em></p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>Data analysis: segment conversion rate <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          conversion\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          channel\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          social&nbsp;media\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         = P(\\text{conversion} \\mid \\text{channel}=\\text{social media})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conversion</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">channel</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">social&nbsp;media</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n <li><p>ML: sensitivity for class <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          k\n         </mi>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          correct&nbsp;prediction\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          class\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          =\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          k\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         k = P(\\text{correct prediction} \\mid \\text{class}=k)\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">correct&nbsp;prediction</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">class</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<p><strong>Bayes’ Theorem</strong></p> \n<p><em>Intuitively</em> It helps \"flip\" a conditional probability: from \"how often <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> happens if cause <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> is true,\" we get \"how likely cause <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> is after observing <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>,\" taking into account our initial belief (prior).</p> \n<p><em>Formally</em> Bayes’ formula: <span class=\"math display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n     <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\n      <semantics>\n       <mrow>\n        <mi>\n         P\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         (\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         A\n        </mi>\n        <mo>\n         ∣\n        </mo>\n        <mi>\n         B\n        </mi>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n         )\n        </mo>\n        <mo>\n         =\n        </mo>\n        <mfrac>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo>\n           ∣\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           A\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n          <mo>\n           ⋅\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           A\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n         <mrow>\n          <mi>\n           P\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           (\n          </mo>\n          <mi>\n           B\n          </mi>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n           )\n          </mo>\n         </mrow>\n        </mfrac>\n        <mo separator=\"true\">\n         ,\n        </mo>\n       </mrow>\n       <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n        P(A \\mid B) = \\frac{P(B \\mid A) \\cdot P(A)}{P(B)},\n       </annotation>\n      </semantics>\n     </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span> where <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(A)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> is the prior probability (initial estimate of <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>), <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n       <mo>\n        ∣\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(B \\mid A)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> is the likelihood (how typical <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> is given <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>), <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        P\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        (\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n       <mo>\n        ∣\n       </mo>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n       <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n        )\n       </mo>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       P(A \\mid B)\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> is the posterior probability (updated estimate of <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        A\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       A\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> after observing <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n    <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <semantics>\n      <mrow>\n       <mi>\n        B\n       </mi>\n      </mrow>\n      <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n       B\n      </annotation>\n     </semantics>\n    </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>).</p> \n<p><em>Application</em></p> \n<ul> \n <li><p>Data analysis: correctly interpreting a positive test for a rare event (taking into account the base prevalence <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          A\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(A)\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li> \n <li><p>ML: Naive Bayes—calculating <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          class\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          features\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{class} \\mid \\text{features})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">class</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">features</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> via <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          features\n         </mtext>\n         <mo>\n          ∣\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          class\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n         <mo>\n          ⋅\n         </mo>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          class\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{features} \\mid \\text{class}) \\cdot P(\\text{class})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">features</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">class</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">class</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> and normalizing by <span class=\"math inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">\n      <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n       <semantics>\n        <mrow>\n         <mi>\n          P\n         </mi>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          (\n         </mo>\n         <mtext>\n          features\n         </mtext>\n         <mo stretchy=\"false\">\n          )\n         </mo>\n        </mrow>\n        <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n         P(\\text{features})\n        </annotation>\n       </semantics>\n      </math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">features</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li> \n</ul> \n<h2 id=\"answer-format\">Answer Format</h2> \n<p>A randomly selected person from the population took the test, and their result was <strong>positive</strong>.</p> \n<p>What is the probability that this person is <strong>actually sick</strong>? Round your answer to four decimal places.</p> \n<p>The answer must be presented as a decimal fraction with four digits after the decimal point, for example, 0.3147.</p>","interaction":null,"inputFormat":null,"outputFormat":null,"notes":null,"scoring":null}